{"server":"cn","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_03_end","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_03","title":"台前幕后","storyCode":"CW-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"d82609c77bd4baf656e8845cafe65cdf1e5bf1eb1d035628f25fee8a6ba41ac5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g9_headquarter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“科技是哥伦比亚的未来”并不是一句漂亮话或者广告语，雅拉主任，我今天像是一个第一次上科学课的孩子，真是大开眼界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜时间太短，还有好多感兴趣的项目没来得及听你们讲解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命随时欢迎您的再次到来，杰克逊先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你，雅拉主任。今天太过兴师动众，希望没有给你带来不便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您太客气了，我今天只是您的导游而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让曾经红极一时的玛丽安娜·布莱克女士充当导游，是我特里蒙之行的又一大收获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞒您说，我也是您的粉丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我收藏了您出道作品的签名海报，并把它贴在了我办公室的墙壁上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实不相瞒，那正是我太太送我的就职礼物，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕瓦尔，有关莱茵生命在特区新建研发基地的申请，或许可以关照一下特区政府的推进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副总统秘书","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"记下来了，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，今天的行程就到这里了，雅拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也祝您在特里蒙接下来的旅程顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好的祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一天已经过去，希望接下来也都是晴天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快拍、快拍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，请问您如何评价这次的莱茵之旅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱茵职员","speakerId":"avg_npc_529_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位不要着急，副总统先生特意留出了十分钟的时间接受采访，请有序发言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"记者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有听错，我正在鼓掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“副总统与莱茵生命人力资源科主任相谈甚欢”“副总统访问助推莱茵生命的科技巨头之路”，我都能猜到这帮记者会配什么标题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活动已经结束，现场没有异常情况，副总统将在十分钟后离开莱茵生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"缪尔赛思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，已经收到了你传过来的路线图。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，还有一条可供潜入的秘密路线，直通地下结构，但不在缪尔赛思给你的图纸上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和迷迭香在上面跟动力甲打得热火朝天，我在连接层蹲守了半天，别说可疑的人了，压根就没有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅会来找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也得先前往地下结构，不是说副总统还有几分钟就要离开了吗，得尽快排除风险才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（压低声音）就这样，伊芙利特开始行动，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上面怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听不太清楚，我没上到地面，但好像没什么特别的动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我估计，没得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照上校的命令，开启了讯号干扰，不支援任何其他单位......应该没有人查到这里来，斐尔迪南提供的潜入路径很隐蔽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行作战计划吧。对一下表......嗯，也差不多到时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸药怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚去查探情况的时候已经布置好了......两管改造过的塑性炸药，足够破坏这层防泄漏装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过斐尔迪南也真够狠的，这可是他们能量科专用的液化源石气管道，他不是还说要回莱茵生命吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按上校的说法，他和咱们现在是拴在一条线上的虫子，没得选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我不明白现在搞这么一场爆破的意义在哪里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统这个时间点应该已经离开莱茵生命了，大楼地下结构的液化源石气管道爆炸，能伤得到他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校自有他的安排，执行命令就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个......孩子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士的情报真准，还真有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们两个，虽然不知道你们躲在这里想干什么，但是可以投降了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有作战单位全部失去联络？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，都是通讯突然中断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现场的情况来看，副总统及随行人员、记者......没有人有特别的反应，看来我们派出的人在行动之前就已经被按下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我们在莱茵内部的行动也出现了混乱，据说受到了一批动力甲的干扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能够监控各个路口的摄像头信号也在陆续被掐断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校，我们正在失去对现场的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能我们布置得天衣无缝的计划，在梅兰德基金会构建的情报网里，根本就是漏洞百出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这起刺杀计划本来就很仓促，他们做出了应对也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校，那......我们要撤离吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然对方的反应这么快，迟早会查到这里来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得副总统先生说过，他希望“和优秀的科研人员好好交流”，我本来也打算满足他这个愿望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"C1、C2那边有什么反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信号稳定，还在指定位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷克，控制面板右上角的那个遥控装置，激活它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"narration","text":"布莱克所说的遥控装置，只是一枚看起来相当普通的机械按钮，还采用了老式的安全阀锁定装置。\n士兵输入密码，透明的安全阀应声弹开，红色的按钮暴露在空气中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校，这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工程炸药的遥控装置，用来炸毁液化源石气管道的阻断结构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看屏幕，对，根据斐尔迪南提供的入侵路线，在莱茵生命大楼的西侧，有几条专供能量科的液化源石气管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命工程科的活儿做得很细致......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了防护装置，还在一定范围内增设了地下阻断结构，应用的特殊材料能够防止泄露的液化源石气引发连环爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本的计划，是通过爆破，造成液化源石气泄露，引发骚乱，为地面上的人创造接近杰克逊的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但巧合的是，杰克逊车队预定的回程路线，正好和液化源石气管道有一处交会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......莱茵生命的员工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着倒是一副不好惹的样子......听说防卫科里有不少脾气很冲的家伙，但也不应该雇佣这么小的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了让你们投降，怎么话那么多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会尽量控制一下，不把你们俩烤成焦炭，毕竟说不定博士和塞雷娅想要亲自审审你们这些坏人，让你们当证人什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你手里拿的是......喷火器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这周围可都是液化源石气管道，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你们是想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火红的萨弗拉孩子在一秒钟之内完成了判断，她扣上火焰放射器的安全锁，抬手用力砸向左边的人。\n下一秒，她全力向右边冲出，一拳挥中右边人的脸颊。\n像是火焰即明即灭，伊芙利特已经重新站稳，并利落地拍了拍手掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的鼻梁大概断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特工B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，你快跑吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，他还是按下了计时器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有不到一分钟了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g11_monitoringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那C1、C2还回得来吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲自向长官们申请，为他们，以及今天殉职的所有战友，发放军功章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校，那可是，一整个副总统车队——五辆车，十多个随行人员，万一附近还有莱茵职员和记者、行人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"服从命令，雷克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由我来亲自按下遥控装置，这是我站在这里的任务......而你的任务，是在C1、C2的爆破信号传来的时候，第一时间向我汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来我可能会站在军事法庭上，接受程序或道德的审判，我不会为自己辩解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以此时此刻，我不想浪费口舌向我的士兵解释什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信号来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统的车队也即将行驶到莱茵生命西侧的指定区域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥伦比亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"布莱克的手放在了那枚冰冷的机械按钮上，凉意瞬间爬上他的手指，他停顿了两秒。\n士兵瞥了一眼自己的长官，墨镜后他的眉毛皱得很紧。\n士兵突然反应过来，其实他比自己还紧张......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莱克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）*哥伦比亚粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"布莱克按下了按钮。\n没有声音，只有部分监视屏上出现了爆炸的画面。\n在那些微缩的视界里，顷刻间沦陷的街道像是泡沫板，火光只是泛白的图像。所有的画面突然消失，大概是摄像头被击飞的砖石摧毁了。\n没有声音，但布莱克和士兵似乎都听见了爆炸声，震耳欲聋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个方向，应该快到地面了才对，但这些石板把路全封住了，看不见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们俩没事吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，是连环爆炸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那个无比熟悉的声音穿透爆炸的余波和土石坠落的窸窣动静，钻进了伊芙利特的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅？我在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听到了......坚持住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"锁定你的位置了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊芙利特清楚地听出了塞雷娅的声音在轻微颤抖，黑暗中，有什么东西触碰到了她的手指......钙质结晶？那是塞雷娅的源石技艺。\n钙质结晶像是稳定的水流，沿着土石的缝隙迅速连成一片，再猛然撑开，周围的结构因为挤压而发出令人牙酸的异响——\n塞雷娅强行在坍塌的地下结构中开出了一条狭窄的甬道。\n一只手伸了下来，伊芙利特跳起握住，一股强大的力量将自己拽向地面，钙质甬道在身后轰然碎裂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g8_alley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，只是碰了点灰而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脸......你刚才哭过了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我才没有哭！只是有点着急了而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，你的手上也都是灰，越擦我脸上越脏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是他俩在地下结构放炸药，炸了液化源石气的管道，所以我把他们带了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是塞雷娅，我没能阻止爆炸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经做得很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊芙利特，你在看什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默？你怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"avg_1031_slent2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，你们会在这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副总统先生，帕瓦尔秘书，现在可以上车了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那个车队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，只是炸毁了一些机甲而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这辆私家车经过了工程科的改装，不起眼，但可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦帕瓦尔秘书充当一下司机，走莱茵生命大楼东侧的特别通道离开，我们已经规划好了新的路线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的其他随行人员，则会在事情结束后分批返回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚的爆炸，也在你们的预料之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有。这种规模的爆炸，如果事先得到了情报，我们肯定会予以排除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在副总统先生回到住所之前，莱茵生命和梅兰德基金会的工作都还没有结束罢了......对方不止一项计划，我们自然也不止一套预案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我不希望明天的新闻上出现“第二个特莱顿工厂”之类的字眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记者那边，我们已经有了安排，请您放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_893_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再一次祝您在特里蒙接下来的旅程顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰克逊","speakerId":"avg_npc_897_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
